{"title":"Plume Torso","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Leatherworking Lv 41) · Monster drop: Glimmerfox, Werewolf, Sand Jackal</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Leatherworking at level 41 <span class=\"muted\">(2906 XP)</span> from 2× <a href=\"#/item/vulture-quill\">Vulture Quill</a>, 6× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sand-jackal\" title=\"Sand Jackal - dropped it in 1 of 52 looted corpses (1/52)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/bb7ca40cbe335f3fe02d.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Jackal</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/52<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"glimmerfox\" title=\"Glimmerfox - dropped it in 4 of 432 looted corpses (1/108)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7418be6744e1d02a8b58.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/108<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf - dropped it in 3 of 3,778 looted corpses (1/1,259)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0ebf199ce603121d6b69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,259<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"plume-torso\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/vulture-quill\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/90d5c9480dcb277fd232.svg\" alt=\"\">Vulture Quill</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/5b91a6e4f4b629fa7a82.svg\" alt=\"Plume Torso\"></div><h3>Plume Torso</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Leatherworking 41</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/27/2026, 1:59:02 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}